    {
      "about": "the fix a formatted-as-text refusal gives",
      "decided": "Select the cell, choose Format > Cells, pick Number under Category on the Numbers tab, and type the price or quantity again, since Calc keeps an already-typed value as text when only the format changes.",
      "at": "invoicer/sheet.py:179"
